{% comment %}
  Section: Compare Widget (Global)
  Renders the floating compare bar exactly once. Add this section to the
  footer group via the theme customizer (Customize > scroll to the footer
  area > Add section > "Compare Widget") so it renders on every page,
  the same way the header and footer do - without needing direct access
  to layout/theme.liquid.

  Previously this was rendered from inside snippets/product-card.liquid,
  once per product card. That caused two problems: it never appeared on
  pages with no product cards (like the product page itself), and having
  several copies of the same #pgs-compare-bar id meant only the first one
  in the DOM actually got updated by the script. Rendering it once here,
  outside of any card markup (which may use CSS transforms that break
  position: fixed on nested elements), fixes both issues.
{% endcomment %}

{% render 'compare-widget' %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Compare Widget",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}